{"id":"08a2576f86e7bd34","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-positivesupport.md","title":"Positive support sets are oriented hitting sets","display":"thm-positivesupport — Positive support sets are oriented hitting sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-positivesupport","aliases":["27-thm-positivesupport"],"display":"thm-positivesupport — Positive support sets are oriented hitting sets","depends_on":["[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.3.1 positive support covering formulation","source_printed_pages":"532","source_pdf_pages":"556","verification_status":"source-formulation-and-order-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-positivesupport"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-positivesupport</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-positivesupport — Positive support sets are oriented hitting sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.3.1 positive support covering formulation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"532"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"556"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-formulation-and-order-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_S\">\\(\\pi_S\\)</span> 由下式构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^S\">\\(\\mathbb B^S\\)</span> 取逐坐标序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^+(a,b)\">\\(J^+(a,b)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_S:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^S,\\qquad\\pi_S(x)\\coloneqq x|_S\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_S:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^S,\\qquad\\pi_S(x)\\coloneqq x|_S\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[n]\\mid\n\\exists g:\\mathbb B^S\\to\\mathbb B\\;\n(g\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\land\n\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb B^S\\;(u\\le v\\Rightarrow g(u)\\le g(v)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[n]\\mid\n\\exists g:\\mathbb B^S\\to\\mathbb B\\;\n(g\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\land\n\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb B^S\\;(u\\le v\\Rightarrow g(u)\\le g(v)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J^+(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid a_j=1\\land b_j=0\\}\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J^+(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid a_j=1\\land b_j=0\\}\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J^+(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J^+(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.3.1，印刷 p.532／PDF p.556。投影正扩张存在当且仅当没有真假投影满足a≤b；否定这个逐坐标比较恰是至少选一个1对0坐标。因此最少正支持是有向差异集的最少击中集，而非任意不等坐标集合。空样本侧时约束为空，空支持可行。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\pi_S$ 由下式构造，$\\mathbb B^S$ 取逐坐标序。$\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)$、$J^+(a,b)$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)","display":false},{"tex":"J^+(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_S:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^S,\\qquad\\pi_S(x)\\coloneqq x|_S\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[n]\\mid\n\\exists g:\\mathbb B^S\\to\\mathbb B\\;\n(g\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\land\n\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb B^S\\;(u\\le v\\Rightarrow g(u)\\le g(v)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J^+(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid a_j=1\\land b_j=0\\}\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}^+(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J^+(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset).","display":true}],"bytes":1816,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-positivesupport|thm-positivesupport — Positive support sets are oriented hitting sets]]"}],"outgoing":["2080bf803b294b75"]}